# bun.lock's format (lockfileVersion 2, written by local bun 1.4.0) is unreadable by the older
# Bun (1.3.14) that's the newest currently available in Railway's Railpack build environment --
# `bun install --frozen-lockfile` hard-fails on it with no fallback. Untracked so each
# environment resolves its own compatible lockfile rather than shipping one that only works
# locally. Revisit once Railway's Railpack bun version catches up.
bun.lock
